<title>UK: Cowie Group unit in rail franchise list.</title>
<headline>Cowie Group unit in rail franchise list.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowie Group Plc said its Great London Railways Ltd division has been shortlisted for the Thameslink Rail franchise, the rail link between Bedford and Brighton.</p>
<p>Great London Railways is a new joint venture between Cowie Group and Thameslink Rail Ltd.</p>
<p>Britain is about halfway through the privatisation, by franchise contract, of 25 train operating companies and a number of firms shortlisted for the latest batch under consideration have announced they have been shortlisted in recent weeks.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
